      "type": "paragraph",
      "reading_order": 7,
      "text": "For the base models, we used a single model obtained by averaging the last 5 checkpoints, which were written at 10-minute intervals. For the big models, we averaged the last 20 checkpoints. We used beam search with a beam size of 4 and length penalty $\\alpha = 0 . 6$ [38]. These hyperparameters were chosen after experimentation on the development set. We set the maximum output length during inference to input length $+ 5 0$ , but terminate early when possible [38]. ",
